<h2 id="mcetoc_1jb86h5eec0">Price</h2>
<p>Minimum booking duration: 2 days (mandatory).</p>
<p>For Direct Bookings: INR (Indian Rupees) 2500 per night (for stays less than 7 days).</p>
<p>Planning to stay for long term? We offer discounts for longer stays (based on stay duration as well as amenities needed). Please <a href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=918982732654&amp;text=Hi%2C%20I%27m%20interested%20in%20*Chez%20Soi%20(1BHK%20in%20CV%20Raman%20Nagar)*%0Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fserenivue.com%2Fchez-soi-1bhk-in-cv-raman-nagar.html%0A%0APrimary%20guest%20name%3A%20%0A%0ANumber%20of%20guests%3A%20%0A%0ACheck-in%20date%3A%20%0A%0ACheckout%20date%3A%20%0A" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">connect with us on Whatsapp Chat</a> so that we can discuss the same. </p>
<p>Important points to keep in mind:</p>
<ul>
<li>You can pay via UPI (if you are from India) or via Paypal (if you are based outside India). Cash payments are not accepted.</li>
<li>There is no security deposit, but 100% of amount needs to be paid before checkin.</li>
<li><strong>Refunds and cancellations</strong>: No cancellation and no refunds on direct bookings via this website. If you want a refundable booking, please book via Airbnb as the Airbnb listing for this house has an option for refundable booking (with Airbnb taking charge of enforcing the cancellation policy as well as process refunds).</li>
</ul>
